From d6df96b0ed2b36b31450a64563333d5abf2681ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nitrogen <Nitrogen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 22:55:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: enforce per-user memory/session isolation for multi-user
 gateway

- Add user_id parameter to MemoryStore and get_memory_dir() for per-user USER.md/MEMORY.md
- Pass user_id from AIAgent to MemoryStore during initialization
- Per-user memory directories: memories/{chat_id}/USER.md, memories/{chat_id}/MEMORY.md
- Adds session_search user_id filtering (from PR #12571)
- Adds Hindsight per-platform retain gate (from PR #12571)

Fixes cross-user data leakage where User A's profile and memory were
injected into User B's system prompt in multi-user gateway deployments.
---
 hermes_state.py                      | 40 +++++++++++++++++++---------
 plugins/memory/hindsight/__init__.py |  9 +++++++
 run_agent.py                         |  3 +++
 tools/memory_tool.py                 | 28 ++++++++++++-------
 tools/session_search_tool.py         |  8 +++---
 5 files changed, 63 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

